        "Wikipedia (English), 'Genesis Rabbah' (cites Strack & Stemberger 1996, pp. 279–280): Strack & Stemberger: 'composed between 400 and 450'; Elbaum: early 5th century; generally dated to the 5th century, with some later additions." ;
    skos:note "Scholars broadly agree on an early-5th-century Palestinian redaction (Strack & Stemberger: 400–450; EJ: beginning of the 5th century; Elbaum: early 5th century), while recognising later additions; its literary relationship to the Yerushalmi is debated."@en ;
