        "Jewish Encyclopedia (1906), 'Ḥabib, Jacob (ben Solomon) ibn': Born at Zamora c. 1460, died at Salonica 1516; publication began in 1516 in the press of Judah Gedaliah; his son R. Levi completed it.",
        "Wikipedia (English), 'Jacob ibn Habib': c. 1460–1516; publication began in 1516 at the press of Judah Gedaliah; he died in Salonica as the first two orders came off the press; his son Levi completed it." ;
