        "Wikipedia (English), 'Ruth Rabbah': One of the earlier midrashim, contemporary with or shortly after Song of Songs Rabbah; Palestinian, with no Babylonian aggadot." ;
    skos:note "It is placed among the early Palestinian midrashim, but because it draws on Pesikta de-Rav Kahana EJ dates it no earlier than the 6th century (its table: 500–640); Zunz's claim that it used the Babylonian Talmud was disproved by Albeck."@en ;
